      "seed": 13, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 13, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "Models    haiku  ·  sonnet  ·  opus\nEffort    low  ·  medium  ·  high  ·  xhigh  ·  max\nCommand   claude -p \"{prompt}\" --model {alias} --effort {level} --output-format json\nOutput    JSON → result.result\n\nIris routing:\n  LOW   →  haiku --effort low\n  MED   →  sonnet --effort high\n  HIGH  →  opus --effort xhigh",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Models    haiku  ·  sonnet  ·  opus\nEffort    low  ·  medium  ·  high  ·  xhigh  ·  max\nCommand   claude -p \"{prompt}\" --model {alias} --effort {level} --output-format json\nOutput    JSON → result.result\n\nIris routing:\n  LOW   →  haiku --effort low\n  MED   →  sonnet --effort high\n  HIGH  →  opus --effort xhigh" },

