      "seed": 23, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 23, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "Models (string EXACTO en settings.json):\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (Low)           ← LOW\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (Medium)        ← (intermedio)\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (High)          ← MED  [current default]\n  Gemini 3.1 Pro (Low)\n  Gemini 3.1 Pro (High)            ← HIGH\n  Claude Sonnet 4.6 (Thinking)\n  Claude Opus 4.6 (Thinking)       ← THINKING\n  GPT-OSS 120B (Medium)\n\nCommand   agy --print \"{prompt}\" --dangerously-skip-permissions --print-timeout 15m0s\nEffort    embebido en nombre del modelo (no hay flag separado)\nOutput    stdout directo",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Models (string EXACTO en settings.json):\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (Low)           ← LOW\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (Medium)        ← (intermedio)\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (High)          ← MED  [current default]\n  Gemini 3.1 Pro (Low)\n  Gemini 3.1 Pro (High)            ← HIGH\n  Claude Sonnet 4.6 (Thinking)\n  Claude Opus 4.6 (Thinking)       ← THINKING\n  GPT-OSS 120B (Medium)\n\nCommand   agy --print \"{prompt}\" --dangerously-skip-permissions --print-timeout 15m0s\nEffort    embebido en nombre del modelo (no hay flag separado)\nOutput    stdout directo" },

