      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "Provider: OpenCode Zen ONLY  (OpenRouter NO configurado)\n\nModels & Variants:\n  opencode/deepseek-v4-flash-free    ← LOW   (no variants)\n  opencode/mimo-v2.5-free            ← MED   (minimal | high | max)\n  opencode/minimax-m3-free                  (no variants)\n  opencode/nemotron-3-super-free     ← HIGH  (minimal | high | max)\n  opencode/big-pickle                       (minimal | high | max)\n\nCommand   opencode run --format json -m {model} --variant {v} \"{prompt}\"\nOutput    JSONL → filtrar type=\"text\" → part.text",
